      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tustin%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The city’s name honors its founder, Columbus Tustin, who arrived in 1868 and shaped early commerce and agriculture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
